<refnamediv>
  <refname><function>SilikoLexerGetToken</function></refname>
  <refpurpose>Function to get the current token from a lexer</refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Lexer.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">const SilikoToken *SilikoLexerGetToken(SilikoLexer *object);</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>The <function>SilikoLexerGetToken</function> function gets the
current token from <varname>object</varname>.</para>
</refsection>

<refsection>
<title>Return Values</title>

<para>A pointer to a <type>SilikoToken</type> object representing the
current token. This object is managed by <varname>object</varname> and
must not be passed to <function>SilikoTokenDestroy</function>. The
pointer is valid until <function>SilikoLexerAdvance</function> is
called on <varname>object</varname>.</para>
</refsection>
